The browser marks are used to name the browser a setting launches. Chrome and
Edge come from SVG Logos (https://github.com/gilbarbara/logos), CC0-1.0,
through Iconify (https://iconify.design); Chromium comes from theSVG
(https://thesvg.org), MIT. Their gradients are simplified to solid colors for
the 16-pixel picker. Brand names and logos remain subject to their respective
trademark policies.
